<ui:UXML xmlns:ui="UnityEngine.UIElements" xmlns:uie="UnityEditor.UIElements" xsi:schemaLocation="UnityEngine.UIElements ../../UIElementsSchema/UnityEngine.UIElements.xsd" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" editor-extension-mode="False">
    <Style src="project:/Assets/UI/Styles/GlobalStyles.uss" />
    <ui:VisualElement name="overlay" class="overlay">
        <ui:VisualElement name="popup-container" class="card-glow" style="width: 95%; max-width: 700px; background-color: rgba(13, 2, 33, 0.92); padding: 50px;">
            <ui:Label name="popup-title" text="CHON CACH DANG NHAP" style="font-size: 40px; color: white; -unity-font-style: bold; margin-bottom: 20px; -unity-text-align: middle-center; letter-spacing: 2px;" />
            <ui:Label name="auth-error" text="" style="color: #FF5252; font-size: 24px; -unity-text-align: middle-center; margin-bottom: 20px; white-space: normal;" />

            <!-- MAIN CHOICE CONTAINER -->
            <ui:VisualElement name="main-choice-container">
                <ui:Button name="goto-login-btn" text="DANG NHAP BANG EMAIL" class="btn btn-secondary" style="width: 100%; font-size: 32px; height: 86px; border-radius: 22px; margin-bottom: 16px;" />
                <ui:Button name="goto-register-btn" text="TAO TAI KHOAN" class="btn btn-primary" style="width: 100%; font-size: 32px; height: 86px; border-radius: 22px; margin-bottom: 16px;" />
                <ui:Button name="goto-guest-btn" text="CHOI VOI TU CACH KHACH" class="btn btn-cancel" style="width: 100%; font-size: 32px; height: 86px; border-radius: 22px;" />
            </ui:VisualElement>

            <!-- LOGIN CONTAINER -->
            <ui:VisualElement name="login-container" style="display: none;">
                <ui:TextField name="login-email" label="Email" style="font-size: 28px; margin-bottom: 20px;" />
                <ui:TextField name="login-password" label="Mat khau" password="true" style="font-size: 28px; margin-bottom: 26px;" />
                <ui:Button name="login-confirm-btn" text="DANG NHAP" class="btn btn-secondary" style="width: 100%; font-size: 34px; height: 86px; border-radius: 22px;" />
                <ui:Button name="forgot-pass-btn" text="Quen mat khau?" class="btn btn-cancel" style="width: 100%; font-size: 24px; height: 52px; border-radius: 16px; margin-top: 12px; border-bottom-width: 0;" />
                <ui:Button name="login-back-btn" text="QUAY LAI" class="btn btn-cancel" style="width: 100%; font-size: 26px; height: 60px; border-radius: 16px; margin-top: 8px;" />
            </ui:VisualElement>

            <!-- REGISTER CONTAINER -->
            <ui:VisualElement name="register-container" style="display: none;">
                <ui:TextField name="reg-display-name" label="Ten hien thi" style="font-size: 28px; margin-bottom: 16px;" />
                <ui:TextField name="reg-email" label="Email" style="font-size: 28px; margin-bottom: 16px;" />
                <ui:TextField name="reg-password" label="Mat khau" password="true" style="font-size: 28px; margin-bottom: 26px;" />
                <ui:Button name="reg-confirm-btn" text="DANG KY" class="btn btn-primary" style="width: 100%; font-size: 34px; height: 86px; border-radius: 22px;" />
                <ui:Button name="reg-back-btn" text="QUAY LAI" class="btn btn-cancel" style="width: 100%; font-size: 26px; height: 60px; border-radius: 16px; margin-top: 14px;" />
            </ui:VisualElement>

            <!-- GUEST CONTAINER -->
            <ui:VisualElement name="guest-container" style="display: none;">
                <ui:Label text="Nhap ten cua ban:" style="color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5); font-size: 26px; margin-bottom: 12px;" />
                <ui:TextField name="guest-name-field" style="font-size: 28px; margin-bottom: 26px;" />
                <ui:Button name="guest-confirm-btn" text="CHOI THU" class="btn btn-secondary" style="width: 100%; font-size: 34px; height: 86px; border-radius: 22px;" />
                <ui:Button name="guest-back-btn" text="QUAY LAI" class="btn btn-cancel" style="width: 100%; font-size: 26px; height: 60px; border-radius: 16px; margin-top: 14px;" />
            </ui:VisualElement>

            <!-- FORGOT PASSWORD CONTAINER -->
            <ui:VisualElement name="forgot-container" style="display: none;">
                <ui:Label text="Nhap email de dat lai mat khau:" style="color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5); font-size: 26px; margin-bottom: 12px;" />
                <ui:TextField name="forgot-email" label="Email" style="font-size: 28px; margin-bottom: 26px;" />
                <ui:Button name="forgot-confirm-btn" text="GUI YEU CAU" class="btn btn-secondary" style="width: 100%; font-size: 34px; height: 86px; border-radius: 22px;" />
                <ui:Button name="forgot-back-btn" text="QUAY LAI" class="btn btn-cancel" style="width: 100%; font-size: 26px; height: 60px; border-radius: 16px; margin-top: 14px;" />
            </ui:VisualElement>
        </ui:VisualElement>
    </ui:VisualElement>
</ui:UXML>
